flowchart TD
    U[User Expert Knowledge] --> CP[copy_pastes / immutable source]
    CP --> PE[Proposition Extractor]
    PE --> CMP[Compare Canon]

    CMP -->|additive/refinement| PLAN[Living Phase Plan]
    CMP -->|conflict| CR[Conflict Resolver]
    CMP -->|time-sensitive capability| CAP[Capability Registry]
    CMP -->|example only| EX[Example Library]

    CR --> PLAN
    CAP --> PLAN
    EX --> PLAN

    PLAN --> GD[Graph Delta]
    GD --> TASK[Task / Checkpoint Delta]
    TASK --> IMP[Implementation / Experiment]
    IMP --> QA[QA + Benchmark]
    QA -->|promote| CANON[Canonical Config / Schema / Code]
    QA -->|quarantine| Q[Quarantine / Failure Memory]
    QA -->|rollback| RB[Rollback]

    CANON --> SM[Success Memory]
    Q --> FM[Failure Memory]
    RB --> FM
    SM --> PLAN
    FM --> PLAN

    subgraph Phase04[Phase 04 Visual-DNA Extraction]
      V[Source Video] --> ING[Ingest / FFprobe]
      ING --> SH[Shot Detection]
      SH --> KF[Keyframes]
      KF --> OCR[OCR / Text Tracks]
      KF --> COL[Color / Gradient]
      KF --> LAY[Layout / Grid]
      KF --> MOT[Optical Flow / Motion Tracks]
      KF --> FX[FX Heuristics]
      KF --> AST[Asset / Material Typing]
      V --> AUD[Audio / Transcript / Beats]

      OCR --> FP[Feature Pack]
      COL --> FP
      LAY --> FP
      MOT --> FP
      FX --> FP
      AST --> FP
      AUD --> FP
      SH --> FP

      FP --> NORM[LLM Normalizer]
      NORM --> TAX[Controlled Taxonomy]
      TAX --> MS[MotionStyle2JSON]
      MS --> SIG[Style Signature + Evidence]
      MS --> REM[Remotion Compiler]
      MS --> FR[Framer Motion Compiler]
      SIG --> KB[Knowledge Store]
    end

    KB --> GEN[GENERATE Planner]
    FP --> REC[RECONSTRUCT_EXACT Measurement Support]
    GEN --> IMP
    REC --> IMP

    classDef evidence fill:#eef,stroke:#446;
    class CP,V,KF,FP,SIG evidence;
